{"4669150": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Against The Light", "steam_appid": 4669150, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >📝 <strong>About This Game</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Against The Light</strong> is a story-driven visual novel set in a futuristic university.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as a student whose life changes after meeting a mysterious girl. What starts as curiosity slowly turns into something deeper, as you spend more time with her and begin to notice that something feels… off.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Through your choices, you’ll shape your relationship, discover hidden sides of the story, and decide how far you’re willing to go to understand the truth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Not everything is what it seems.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And sometimes, the closer you get to the light… the more it blinds you.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >✨ <strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A focused, story-rich visual novel experience</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choices that influence the story and its outcome</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>3 different endings</strong> depending on your decisions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A mix of sci-fi setting and character-driven narrative</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Original soundtrack performed by a real pianist <br> <br> <br> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4669150/extras/15d3e3d7c8350575f187698d649b5474.avif?t=1777036931\" /></span><br> <br>Some visual assets in this game have been created with the assistance of AI tools, then refined and integrated to fit the artistic direction of the project.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All music featured in the game is <strong>original</strong> and performed by a <strong>real pianist</strong>, composed specifically to enhance the emotional experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >📝 <strong>About This Game</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Against The Light</strong> is a story-driven visual novel set in a futuristic university.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as a student whose life changes after meeting a mysterious girl. What starts as curiosity slowly turns into something deeper, as you spend more time with her and begin to notice that something feels… off.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Through your choices, you’ll shape your relationship, discover hidden sides of the story, and decide how far you’re willing to go to understand the truth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Not everything is what it seems.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And sometimes, the closer you get to the light… the more it blinds you.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >✨ <strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A focused, story-rich visual novel experience</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choices that influence the story and its outcome</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>3 different endings</strong> depending on your decisions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A mix of sci-fi setting and character-driven narrative</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Original soundtrack performed by a real pianist <br> <br> <br> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4669150/extras/15d3e3d7c8350575f187698d649b5474.avif?t=1777036931\" /></span><br> <br>Some visual assets in this game have been created with the assistance of AI tools, then refined and integrated to fit the artistic direction of the project.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All music featured in the game is <strong>original</strong> and performed by a <strong>real pianist</strong>, composed specifically to enhance the emot